{"symbol":"METHODHUB","yahoo":"METHODHUB.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Methodhub Software Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://www.methodhub.in","about":"Methodhub Software Limited provides information technology (IT) and consulting services in India, the United States, Mexico, Costa Rica, and Canada. It offers cloud services; data and artificial intelligence, enterprise resource planning, customer relationship management integration, recruitment delivery, combined offering, technology modernization, consulting, and managed services. The company also provides IT infrastructure, including computer systems, networks, and complete IT environment management; cybersecurity services, which comprises vulnerability assessments, penetration testing, intrusion detection and prevention systems, and security information and event management; identity and access management, and managed security services. It serves IT consulting, banking, financial services, insurance, oil and gas/energy, healthcare and life sciences, telecom/tech infrastructure, and automotive/transport industries. Methodhub Software Limited was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Bengaluru, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:59:17+00:00","quote":{"price":68.49,"prevClose":68.11,"marketCap":129.13,"high52":171.95,"low52":58.8,"pe":3.34,"bookValue":81.2,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":37.86,"shares":1.8853,"insiders":59.14,"institutions":2.32},"prices":{"dates":["2025-12-12","2025-12-15","2025-12-16","2025-12-17","2025-12-18","2025-12-19","2025-12-22","2025-12-23","2025-12-24","2025-12-26","2025-12-29","2025-12-30","2025-12-31","2026-01-01","2026-01-02","2026-01-05","2026-01-06","2026-01-07","2026-01-08","2026-01-09","2026-01-12","2026-01-13","2026-01-14","2026-01-16","2026-01-19","2026-01-20","2026-01-21","2026-01-22","2026-01-23","2026-01-27","2026-01-28","2026-01-29","2026-01-30","2026-02-02","2026-02-03","2026-02-04","2026-02-05","2026-02-06","